{"v":4,"catch":"準備好迎接即將到來的強大敵軍的入侵吧！","desc":"《MOON SHUTTLE》是Nichibutsu於1981年發行的射擊遊戲。\n玩家可以享受交替的階段，在這些階段中，他們摧毀或躲避成群的流星以到達目標，以及在階段中他們用波動砲擊敗敵人。\n\n“Arcade Archives”系列忠實再現了許多經典的Arcade傑作。\n玩家可以改變各種遊戲設置，例如游戲難度，並且還可以重現那時的街機顯示設置的氛圍。 玩家也可以通過高分來與世界各地的選手展開競爭。\n請享受為視頻遊戲打造一代的傑作。","publisher":"HAMSTER","release":"2024-10-03","genres":["射擊","街機"],"players":"單機 1–2 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文"],"pmax":2,"poff":2,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/97974b8a57a4d7abf74bb28f7104fbc222d377f8dc598f27a156cf67161eea51.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/6cf17ff5f2190fcff811b0a5e3dc140f3a5d1d9dd7b405bb2e8a0da4bf1ab7a3.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/0999de59531e0807ee7fb0e379ce3541aba0f6fca1749f449faa901fbeb50fa6.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/ef5a6f174fb270a14845588b33238345dad5d012b0578b86ce3100da14a85afc.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/308dd996fc3b88ac0ba6f68dbbbb77b8f413e6a2d99cfec0b5879b2fb71d1f21.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/df2e6fa44d081f98bcdf588c8ead80c45702bef2b5e33946d5c96654b0628f36.jpg"],"titleId":"01009a601e0dc000","dlc":[]}